{"unit_id":"tag:09WY:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n继续沿用我们的约定，说“Hausdorff 且局部拟紧（quasi-compact）”，而不采用文献中常见的说法“局部紧（locally compact）”。设 <MATH_0001> 表示范畴（category），其对象（objects）为 Hausdorff 且局部拟紧（quasi-compact）的拓扑空间（topological spaces），其态射（morphisms）为连续（continuous）映射（maps）。\n\n","allowed_english":["Hausdorff"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"locally compact","target_term":"局部紧"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"两处都由 locally 限定"},{"source_term":"locally compact","target_term":"局部紧","context":"与本文约定不同的文献用语"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"本节研究的空间范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"范畴中的空间"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"Hausdorff 局部拟紧空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"空间范畴的态射"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续","context":"映射的拓扑性质"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"范畴中的连续映射"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09WZ:statement","translation":"范畴（category）<MATH_0001> 有纤维积（fibre products）和终对象（final object），因而有任意有限极限（finite limits）。给定态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003>，位于 <MATH_0004> 中，若 <MATH_0005> 和 <MATH_0006> 为拟紧（quasi-compact）的，则 <MATH_0007> 为拟紧（quasi-compact）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"Hausdorff 局部拟紧空间的范畴"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"该范畴中的纤维积"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"该范畴的终对象"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限","context":"由纤维积和终对象给出的极限"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"定义纤维积的态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"空间及其纤维积的拟紧性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09WZ:proof","translation":"终对象（final object）是单点（singleton）空间（space）。给定态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002>，属于 <MATH_0003> 的，纤维积（fibre product）<MATH_0004> 为子空间（subspace），属于 <MATH_0005>。因此 <MATH_0006> 为 Hausdorff 的，因为 <MATH_0007> 为 Hausdorff 的，由《拓扑（Topology）》第 <REF_0001> 节。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n若 <MATH_0008> 和 <MATH_0009> 为拟紧（quasi-compact）的，则 <MATH_0010> 为拟紧（quasi-compact）的，由《拓扑（Topology）》定理 <REF_0002>。由于 <MATH_0011> 是闭子集（closed subset），属于 <MATH_0012> 的（《拓扑（Topology）》引理 <REF_0003>），可知 <MATH_0013> 为拟紧（quasi-compact）的，由《拓扑（Topology）》引理 <REF_0004>。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n最后，回到一般情形，若 <MATH_0014> 和 <MATH_0015>，可以选取拟紧（quasi-compact）的邻域（neighbourhoods）<MATH_0016> 和 <MATH_0017>，由上面的结果，可知 <MATH_0018> 为拟紧（quasi-compact）的邻域（neighbourhood），属于 <MATH_0019> 的。因此 <MATH_0020> 为对象（object），属于 <MATH_0021> 的，由《拓扑（Topology）》引理 <REF_0005>。\n","allowed_english":["Hausdorff"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"singleton","target_term":"单点"},{"source_term":"space","target_term":"空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"subspace","target_term":"子空间"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"neighbourhoods","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"单点空间"},{"source_term":"singleton","target_term":"单点","context":"只有一个点的空间"},{"source_term":"space","target_term":"空间","context":"单点拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"形成纤维积的两个态射"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积","context":"空间的纤维积"},{"source_term":"subspace","target_term":"子空间","context":"纤维积作为积空间的子空间"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节标题"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"空间、纤维积与邻域的性质"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集","context":"纤维积在积空间中闭"},{"source_term":"neighbourhoods","target_term":"邻域","context":"两侧点的拟紧邻域"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域","context":"纤维积点的拟紧邻域"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"纤维积属于该范畴"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09WY:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n可以赋予 <MATH_0001> 一个比通常拓扑（topology）更强的拓扑。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"比通常拓扑更强的拓扑"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09X0:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为态射族（family of morphisms），具有固定的余域（target），位于范畴（category）<MATH_0002> 中。称此族为\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>qc 覆盖（qc covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这是非标准记号（nonstandard notation）。选取它，是为了让读者联想到 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc coverings），对于概形（schemes）的。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>\n如果对每个 <MATH_0003>，存在 <MATH_0004> 及拟紧（quasi-compact）的子集（subsets）<MATH_0005>，使得 <MATH_0006> 为邻域（neighbourhood），对应于 <MATH_0007>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"余域"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"qc covering","target_term":"qc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"nonstandard notation","target_term":"非标准记号"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"subsets","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"具有同一余域的态射族"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"余域","context":"态射的固定余域"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"Hausdorff 局部拟紧空间范畴"},{"source_term":"qc covering","target_term":"qc 覆盖","context":"本定义引入的覆盖名称，保留 qc 缩写"},{"source_term":"nonstandard notation","target_term":"非标准记号","context":"原文对 qc 名称的脚注说明"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"概形的 fpqc 覆盖，用于解释记号"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"脚注中的概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"覆盖条件中的子集"},{"source_term":"subsets","target_term":"子集","context":"覆盖条件选取的拟紧子集"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域","context":"像的并构成邻域"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09WY:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，一个开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0001>，覆盖对象（object），属于 <MATH_0002> 的，给出 qc 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>，因为 <MATH_0004> 为局部拟紧（quasi-compact）的。从必不可少的引理开始。\n\n","allowed_english":["qc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"开覆盖"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"开覆盖","context":"此处由 open 限定"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"该空间范畴中的对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"此处由 qc 缩写限定"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"此处由 locally 限定"}],"notes":[]}
